, "Actually, I'm going to reset. >> An An has been slain."], [464.0, ">> Not my first choice. >> 6 5 4 3"], [477.1, "2 1 >> An enemy has been slain."], [482.4, ">> You have my undivided attention."], [504.1, ">> There is no one like you."], [522.2, ">> I have mastered the spin of war."], [543.6, ">> I learned from a young age to embrace the shadow. >> I got my boys lagging my team."], [565.4, ">> The rage is in your hands. Let it loose."], [581.4, ">> This will only dull the blade."], [593.9, "Fear this. You'll do nothing without me."], [616.0, "Holy crap. Let my unit pop off."], [627.4, "Doing the flaming team tech? No, I just moved my chat out of the way cuz if I read the chat, I'd lose my mind."], [641.5, "Like, I know you can just deafen and it turns off chat, but genuinely, like just seeing the chat like rage baits me when when like there's stuff going on that is just like so tilting."], [652.2, "You know what I mean, King Torb? It's like instead of like just not seeing it, I just need it completely removed."], [663.2, ">> My heart cuts through the lies of unwilling."], [684.7, ">> All right. Let's look for bots and Gibbs. I need my bastion breaker."], [702.8, "I think as long as my mid laner is ahead we should be fine. Yeah, it's the same when people start typing too much."], [713.9, "Yeah, the dragon chat off screen is just like high IQ tech. Sometimes leave chat on if people are legitimately not tilted and talking strat."], [723.4, "Oh yeah, for sure. No, yeah, yeah. I understand that. But that's just rarely ever the case."], [761.6, "Tobia, how's it going? All right. I see you got this objective. Not bad."], [767.8, "Get the objective, not bad."], [787.9, "All right, it's Manic Cow Monday. Yes, it is Noah."], [792.8, "You came at the perfect time. I hope you all have been enjoying Manic Cow Mondays."], [799.4, "We got destroyed by a girl earlier today, Noah. It was awesome."], [855.0, ">> I knew someone was dying. I just didn't know who it was. I'll take Si